{"nodes": [{"id": "vault_adr_0201_a_set_shaped_by_hand_and_heard_live_decision", "label": "ADR 0201: A set shaped by hand on its timeline, heard live from a worker, with headroom where songs play together", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "vault/adr/0201-a-set-shaped-by-hand-and-heard-live.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Planned sets could not be shaped or heard inside GLUE. The user (2026-11-27): previews did not work and the set looked terrible, and exported double drops were noisy. Causes: two loud songs at full summed about 6 dB over the ceiling; the limiter dropped gain in 64-sample steps (a buzz); WSOLA's raw correlation picked grains off the song's own continuation. The preview runs in a worker, not in the AudioWorklet, because copying each song's PCM into the audio thread lets a decode or garbage collection stall it. Consequences: exported sets sound a little different (overlaps 3 dB lower where both songs were at full); the preview needs a song's file when the mix reaches it, so in Home mode the first play of a stretch can wait."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0201_a_set_shaped_by_hand_and_heard_live_hand_edits", "label": "Hand edits in whole bars: move a song, trim its in-point, move its end", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0201-a-set-shaped-by-hand-and-heard-live.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Always in whole bars, clamped to the nearest bar that keeps the set whole. Moving a song shifts it and the ones after it; the song before plays on, so its hand-over grows or shrinks."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0201_a_set_shaped_by_hand_and_heard_live_valid_rule", "label": "The set-holds-together rule (valid)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0201-a-set-shaped-by-hand-and-heard-live.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each song plays at least a bar inside its file; each comes in at least a bar after the one before while that one still plays (no silence); each outlasts the one before; songs on one deck do not overlap."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0201_a_set_shaped_by_hand_and_heard_live_running_order_and_undo", "label": "Running order dragged, and undo and redo of every plan version (100 deep)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0201-a-set-shaped-by-hand-and-heard-live.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reordering plans the set again and undoes any hand edits (Undo brings them back). A drag is one undo step."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0201_a_set_shaped_by_hand_and_heard_live_live_preview_worker", "label": "Live preview: a worker about 1.2 s ahead feeding a small AudioWorklet", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0201-a-set-shaped-by-hand-and-heard-live.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Replaces ADR 0199's plan of a Mixer inside the worklet. A worker a second ahead absorbs decode and garbage-collection pauses; only blocks cross a MessagePort. SharedArrayBuffer was rejected: it needs cross-origin isolation, which GitHub Pages does not serve. The worklet plays the newest generation (each seek or edit starts one)."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0201_a_set_shaped_by_hand_and_heard_live_headroom", "label": "Headroom where songs play together", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0201-a-set-shaped-by-hand-and-heard-live.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "When the sounding songs add up to more than one song's power (sum of gains squared over 1), each comes down by its square root, as a DJ rides the faders. Equal-power blends are unchanged; two songs at full come down 3 dB each. Leaving it to the limiter was rejected: the limiter is for peaks, not 6 dB of overlap."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0201_a_set_shaped_by_hand_and_heard_live_limiter", "label": "Gliding look-ahead limiter", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0201-a-set-shaped-by-hand-and-heard-live.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The gain a peak needs is held for a 256-sample look-ahead and averaged over it, so it glides down and is fully down when the peak arrives. Per sample, 250 ms release. The earlier limiter dropped gain at once in 64-sample steps, which buzzed."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0201_a_set_shaped_by_hand_and_heard_live_wsola_key_lock", "label": "WSOLA key lock by normalised correlation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0201-a-set-shaped-by-hand-and-heard-live.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Grains are compared by normalised correlation over the whole overlap, and the song's own continuation is a candidate. Raw correlation could pick a grain off that continuation even when nothing was stretched. At a song's own tempo, key lock gives the song back sample for sample."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0201_a_set_shaped_by_hand_and_heard_live_timeline_drawn_as_heard", "label": "Timeline: songs drawn as heard", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0201-a-set-shaped-by-hand-and-heard-live.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One canvas per lane, the width of the view, each pixel through the tempo map to each song's time. One canvas per song was blurred past 4096 px and stretched where tempo eases. A song's waveform shrinks with its volume and loses its lows while its bass is cut, over a ghost of the song as it is."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0201_a_set_shaped_by_hand_and_heard_live_signalsmith_stretch", "label": "Signalsmith Stretch for key lock (the next step if WSOLA is not clean enough)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0201-a-set-shaped-by-hand-and-heard-live.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ADR 0199's fallback. Not needed yet: the noise heard came from the limiter and the grain search, which this decision fixes."}, {"id": "src_core_sets_edit", "label": "src/core/sets/edit.ts (hand edits, pure)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "vault/adr/0201-a-set-shaped-by-hand-and-heard-live.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_workers_setplay_worker", "label": "src/workers/setplay.worker.ts (live preview mixer)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "vault/adr/0201-a-set-shaped-by-hand-and-heard-live.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_lib_sets_preview_svelte", "label": "src/lib/sets/preview.svelte.ts (AudioWorklet preview)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "vault/adr/0201-a-set-shaped-by-hand-and-heard-live.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_ui_sets_setlanes_svelte", "label": "src/ui/sets/SetLanes.svelte (timeline lanes)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "vault/adr/0201-a-set-shaped-by-hand-and-heard-live.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_core_sets_dsp", "label": "src/core/sets/dsp.ts (headroom, limiter, WSOLA)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "vault/adr/0201-a-set-shaped-by-hand-and-heard-live.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_core_sets_mixer", "label": "src/core/sets/mixer.ts (Mixer engine)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "vault/adr/0201-a-set-shaped-by-hand-and-heard-live.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_workers_setdecode", "label": "src/workers/setDecode.ts (song decoding, shared by preview and export)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "vault/adr/0201-a-set-shaped-by-hand-and-heard-live.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "vault_adr_0201_a_set_shaped_by_hand_and_heard_live_decision", "target": "vault_adr_0199_a_set_is_a_playlist_mixed_by_one_engine_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/adr/0201-a-set-shaped-by-hand-and-heard-live.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_adr_0201_a_set_shaped_by_hand_and_heard_live_decision", "target": "vault_adr_0200_planning_a_set_on_phrases_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/adr/0201-a-set-shaped-by-hand-and-heard-live.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_adr_0201_a_set_shaped_by_hand_and_heard_live_decision", "target": "src_core_sets_edit", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/adr/0201-a-set-shaped-by-hand-and-heard-live.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_adr_0201_a_set_shaped_by_hand_and_heard_live_decision", "target": "src_workers_setplay_worker", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/adr/0201-a-set-shaped-by-hand-and-heard-live.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_adr_0201_a_set_shaped_by_hand_and_heard_live_decision", "target": "src_lib_sets_preview_svelte", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/adr/0201-a-set-shaped-by-hand-